@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ito-il30-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-55b-kibbutz-member`

-- Tests for s 55(b). Expected values read from the section: income transferred to the kibbutz stays under the sub-chapter; income not transferred is
-- assessed apart, and the credit points, the rates and the losses of the kibbutz's assessment are left out.

§ `Tests of section 55(b)`

#ASSERT `s 55 — the member's income is assessed` TRUE EQUALS `under the sub-chapter on the kibbutz and its members`
#ASSERT `s 55 — the member's income is assessed` FALSE EQUALS `apart from that sub-chapter, the rates and credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment and the kibbutz's losses not being counted`
-- Left out: only for the income not transferred.
#ASSERT `s 55(b) — the credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment are left out of the member's assessment of income` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 55(b) — the credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment are left out of the member's assessment of income` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 55(b) — the rates counted in the kibbutz's assessment are left out of the member's assessment of income` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 55(b) — the rates counted in the kibbutz's assessment are left out of the member's assessment of income` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 55(b) — the kibbutz's losses are left out of the member's assessment of income` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 55(b) — the kibbutz's losses are left out of the member's assessment of income` TRUE
